  "notable_quotes": [
    "MAC-11 retains framework integrity in water and undergoes a thermo/water-induced reversible phase transformation with photoluminescence shifting from 418 to 453 nm.",
    "The photoluminescence response mechanism of MAC-11 was proposed by comparison with MAC-13, MAC-14, layered [Zn(dmtrz)(HCOO)], and the H2L1 ligand.",
    "Conventional flexible luminescent MOFs based on carboxylate angle adjustment may show limited energy-state changes because carboxylates are σ-bond separated from organic emitters."
